  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "（2024/12/13記載）商品名を変更させていただきました。",
      "en": "(Posted on 12/13/2024) The product name has been changed."
    },
    {
      "ja": "大阪・関西万博「GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION」にて上映の完全新規映像に登場する「RX-78F00/E ガンダム」をENTRY GRADEで商品化！",
      "en": "The \"RX-78F00/E Gundam \" that appears in the completely new video screened at the Osaka/Kansai Expo \" GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION\" will be commercialized with ENTRY GRADE!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• “簡単組み立て×ハイクオリティ”を両立。",
      "en": "• Achieves both “easy assembly and high quality”."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 広い可動域で自由自在にポージング可能。",
      "en": "• Can be freely posed with a wide range of motion."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ビーム・ライフルやハンドパーツなどが付属。",
      "en": "• Beam rifle and hand parts are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りの「EXPO2025 ENTRY GRADE 1/144 RX-78F00/E ガンダム用オプションパーツセット (EX-001 グラスフェザー装備)」と組み合わせることで「GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION」の映像に登場するグラスフェザー装備の状態を再現可能。",
      "en": "• By combining with the separately sold \"EXPO2025 ENTRY GRADE 1/144 RX-78F00/E Gundam optional parts set (EX-001 glass feather equipped)\", it is possible to reproduce the state of the glass feather equipped that appears in the \" GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION\" video."
    }
